1
00:00:06,393 --> 00:00:07,993
(Raj:)Hey. Thanks
for coming by.

2
00:00:07,996 --> 00:00:09,796
(Leonard:)Yeah. I'm excited to help.

3
00:00:09,797 --> 00:00:11,467
(Raj:)I would have included
the others, but...

4
00:00:11,466 --> 00:00:13,066
(Raj:)you know exactly
what would've happened.

5
00:00:13,067 --> 00:00:15,467
(Raj:)They would've taken over the
project and bossed us around.

6
00:00:15,470 --> 00:00:16,970
(Leonard:)I get it.

7
00:00:16,971 --> 00:00:19,441
(Leonard:)Uh, just this morning, Sheldon
wouldn't let me put almond milk

8
00:00:19,440 --> 00:00:20,770
(Leonard:)on my Grape-Nuts because he said

9
00:00:20,775 --> 00:00:23,805
(Leonard:)it was
a theoretical nut conflict.

10
00:00:23,811 --> 00:00:26,211
(Raj:)You should have told him
to mind his own business.

11
00:00:26,214 --> 00:00:28,814
(Leonard:)Yeah. That's better
than what I did say, which was,

12
00:00:28,816 --> 00:00:31,556
"Fine, I'll eat them
with club soda."

13
00:00:31,553 --> 00:00:35,083
(Raj:)What makes them think they're
always in charge of everything?

14
00:00:35,089 --> 00:00:36,289
(Leonard:)Mmm, they're alpha males.

15
00:00:36,291 --> 00:00:37,921
(chuckles)
What does that make us?

16
00:00:37,926 --> 00:00:39,956
(Leonard:)We could be betas.
They're second in charge.

17
00:00:39,961 --> 00:00:40,961
(Raj:)Okay, that sounds good.

18
00:00:40,962 --> 00:00:42,262
(Leonard:)Or we could be omegas.

19
00:00:42,263 --> 00:00:44,963
(Leonard:)They get pushed around
by the alphas and the betas.

20
00:00:44,966 --> 00:00:47,296
(Raj:)Okay, that sounds like us.

21
00:00:47,302 --> 00:00:49,572
(Leonard:)Whatever. There's
no alphas here,

22
00:00:49,571 --> 00:00:51,441
(Leonard:)and this is
your project.

23
00:00:51,439 --> 00:00:53,509
(Leonard:)You're in charge.
How do you want to start?

24
00:00:53,508 --> 00:00:56,338
(Raj:)I don't know.
How do you want to start?

25
00:00:57,311 --> 00:01:01,021
(Raj:)I don't know.

